+
+## Deliberate limits of x9i
+
+x9i is a **prescribed static contact-angle normal closure**, not yet a complete
+wall free-energy model.  It does not add contact-angle hysteresis, dynamic
+contact-angle laws, slip/contact-line mobility, wall surface energies, or a
+special corner model.  It also does not redefine wall particle kinetics.
+
+The next physical qualification should inspect the INFO curvature bias for the
+60/90/120 caps, then run longer sessile-drop relaxations to verify equilibrium
+angle, area conservation and parasitic currents.  Only after that is it useful
+to tune/refine the near-wall curvature reconstruction if necessary.
